    {
      "id": "dDTdoHMHv9pVpduxQIBXx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 707.998046875,
      "y": 517.076774597168,
      "width": 173.1678466796875,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1619457968,
      "version": 134,
      "versionNonce": 316702128,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791297042037,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Instead of just using\nfetch, we're going to\ncreate an \"APIClient\"\nthat uses fetch but\nalso our tokens in the\nheaders of the reqs.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Instead of just using\nfetch, we're going to\ncreate an \"APIClient\"\nthat uses fetch but\nalso our tokens in the\nheaders of the reqs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0m88oG5mwcCfpPLHghvns",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 358.81187438964844,
      "y": 327.4284133911133,
      "width": 315.0237121582031,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 985567152,
      "version": 473,
      "versionNonce": 461422000,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791297298228,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"AuthContext\"\n\nProvider is going to wrap \nthe entire app. Think your global state.\n\nHook is going to be used in all of our\ncomponents\n- be able to login and perform the tasks\n- store the local token in memory\n- perform all the mutations of logging in\n- give us the user information",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"AuthContext\"\n\nProvider is going to wrap \nthe entire app. Think your global state.\n\nHook is going to be used in all of our\ncomponents\n- be able to login and perform the tasks\n- store the local token in memory\n- perform all the mutations of logging in\n- give us the user information",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
